{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はレッスンでした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスンルームにぞくぞくと\nメンバーが入ってくるんだけど\nみんな元気過ぎ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな休みは実家に帰ったりして\nえんじょいしてたんやな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/04/0984186/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****HaPPy BirThDAy*****"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさ♡2013.1.4"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさ先輩"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/04/0984186/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...だけど甘えん坊なんだよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前夜にみんなで\nコンビニ行ったらね、\n私に寄ってきて甘えてきてん^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時にごにょごにょっと\nみさのおねえたまは\nまりか～って言ってたー笑\n眠そうやったー笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごいしっかり物のお姉さんだけど\nけっこうぬけてるし！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハレンチをフレンチって言うしっ！\n(みさのブログ読んでね)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おもしろいです！\nそんなみさ先輩すきです！照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リクエスト8\nみさ先輩にちゅーされるまりか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/04/0984186/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/04/0984186/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゃは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪切ったけどそんなに変わってない\nって言う方が多かったね。\nたしかにロングのままだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや！変わったんだぜ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/04/0984186/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？！\n定規！定規！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真じゃわからないかあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーからは\n幼くなった、大人っぽくなった\nどっちも言われました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...どっちなんでしょね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/04/0984186/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の幕張全握。\nふぁみたんのみなさん、\nよろしくお願いします♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブも楽しみねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/04/0984186/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では明日全握で会いましょう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/04/0984186/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}